    <string name="hardware_validation">Only the V1 elliptical has been tested on physical equipment. Other devices still need validation.</string>
    <string name="compatibility_detail">V1, V2 and FTMS capabilities depend on the actual services and data received. The app does not drive treadmill motors. OpenMOBI is an independent community project, not an official MOBI service.</string>
    <string name="debug_build_help">Debug includes simulated devices and installs alongside the standard app. On the release page, choose the APK ending in -debug.</string>
    <string name="release_build_help">Standard app, without simulated devices. On the release page, choose the APK without -debug.</string>
